      "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"bluedarky\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/bluedarky/48/1975_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> bluedarky:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>The same thing happens with The Chairman if you eliminate The Chairman before The Operative and Undivided Attention comes out.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Indeed</p>\n<p>Undivided Attention:</p>\n<blockquote>\nIF THE OPERATIVE IS ACTIVE, SHE DEALS THE HERO WITH THE HIGHEST HP 4 MELEE DAMAGE.\n<p>THE CHAIRMAN DEALS THE HERO WITH THE HIGHEST HP 3 MELEE DAMAGE.</p>\n</blockquote>\nThis seems to be evidence that The Chairman can deal damage even when incapacitated. Perhaps the same is true of Anvil.",
