      "raw": "[quote=\"bluedarky\"]\n\nThe same thing happens with The Chairman if you eliminate The Chairman before The Operative and Undivided Attention comes out.\n\n[/quote]\n\nIndeed\n\nUndivided Attention:\n<blockquote>\nIF THE OPERATIVE IS ACTIVE, SHE DEALS THE HERO WITH THE HIGHEST HP 4 MELEE DAMAGE.\n\nTHE CHAIRMAN DEALS THE HERO WITH THE HIGHEST HP 3 MELEE DAMAGE.\n</blockquote>\nThis seems to be evidence that The Chairman can deal damage even when incapacitated. Perhaps the same is true of Anvil.\n",
