      "created_at": "2017-05-07T14:26:57.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>We know from the video game if the Chairman is destroyed he can't deal damage from Undivided Attention. &nbsp;Hammer and Anvil should probably have wording about being active to clarify but if they are incapped they can't do actions associated with them on a card. &nbsp;</p>",
