      "can_wiki": false,
      "read": false,
      "user_title": null,
      "bookmarked": false,
      "raw": "<p>Nothing that&#39;s incapacitated or otherwise destroyed can do damage, unless that damage is the direct result of the process of it being destroyed (as with Sonic Mine).</p><p>If you kill, say, the Genebound Frosthound before it&#39;s hit every hero target, it stops dealing damage.</p><p>Same reason you don&#39;t see any hero Incap abilities that say, &quot;You do one target X damage.&quot; It&#39;s always, &quot;One hero target can do X damage,&quot; or &quot;one villain target does X damage to itself.&quot;</p>",
