      "created_at": "2017-05-08T17:38:32.000Z",
      "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"Powerhound_2000\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/powerhound_2000/48/1859_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Powerhound_2000:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>We know from the video game if the Chairman is destroyed he can't deal damage from Undivided Attention. &nbsp;Hammer and Anvil should probably have wording about being active to clarify but if they are incapped they can't do actions associated with them on a card. &nbsp;</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Ah … hadn't taken the time to test it in the video game.</p>",
